# clamber-scenario v1
id: walk-off-ledge
summary: Walk off a ledge without jumping and fall to lower ground.
requires: a ledge 48 to 64 px ahead, a drop of at least 96 px to flat ground below
start: grounded, idle for at least 30 frames, facing right, lead character
frames: 120

[inputs]
0-119    R

[metrics]
final_x          tol 1
curve x,y,vy from leave_ground for 30 tol 0.25
